WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,920
Brother, are you here to sail the boat?

2
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,060
I want to take advantage of the ebb tide

3
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,340
Find an isolated island and get into trouble

4
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,780
I'm going to ask you, Brother Wang, to buy some ice cubes.

5
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:16,820
Went to sea yesterday

6
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,780
I didn’t make ice because I wasn’t prepared, but it’s okay.

7
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:22,170
Maybe because it rained all day yesterday

8
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,370
The rain persisted to the safe haven

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,660
Wife, get me a bucket of ice

10
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,140
How much ice do I need? Is five buckets enough?

11
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,380
Enough. How much?

12
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,580
Brother, that's what you said

13
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:33,580
Do you want to slap me in the face?

14
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,580
My brother wants to hit a bucket of ice

15
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,580
I am Wang Zhiqiang

16
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,940
Can I still ask for your money?

17
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,460
Isn't this bad?

18
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,500
If anything goes wrong, you need ice later

19
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,620
Just get it from me

20
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,620
Brother gives it away for free without taking any penny.

21
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,580
Then thank you brother

22
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,540
What did my brother say?

23
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:49,500
No thanks

24
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,780
I'll have some good stuff from now on.

25
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:51,700
Just send it over

26
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,300
Brother will definitely give you a high price

27
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:02,870
This time I'm going to do another big one
